的程度。\n\n賣點是看起來很豪華的海鮮，海鮮類的新鮮度不錯，但跟湯還有麵沒有很融為一體的感覺。叉燒相對來說就很一般，不會覺得很雷，但台北市這個拉麵一級戰區有太多更厲害的叉燒。",null,[0,87]]]],[null,1777130421000000,1777130421000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOGZCLUY0Z1NRT0ZQY1B4Yk1ZLUlxZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfOGZCLUY0Z1NRT0ZQY1B4Yk1ZLUlxZxoTQ2d3SXRiZXp6d1lRNzZPRG53RQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiijuC999mWAxWculYBHdcnF-EQ_2MIWygK"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLV21ORmJIZGlhbVIyVGxZNVRXVkZOVWhSYldSaFRGaHdkbGd3UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的詳細回饋與理性分享🙏\n很抱歉這次的整體用餐體驗，未能讓您覺得有足夠的驚喜與記憶點。\n關於您提到海鮮與湯麵之間的融合感，以及叉燒在整體表現上的感受，我們會再重新檢視餐點設計與風味平衡，持續優化各元素之間的整合性。\n我們也理解每位客人對拉麵的期待不同，您的意見我們會認真納入參考。謝謝您的指教。",null,[0,149]]]],[null,null,14212,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKWmNFbHdiamR2TlY5TWVFNUhRbWRhTFhwdlgwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5e3dae69e6c8d0af!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF