。汽車-可停永樂市場地下停車場（但易滿位）。機車-可停市場附近。\n價格：中上價位，CP值一般。收現金。\n食材：食材新鮮，叉燒肉一片是偏厚的那種。\n口感：湯頭剛好不偏鹹，會給一杯麥茶。\n服務：菜單看完至入口吧台點餐、付款。服務算親切，送餐速度尚可。內場 3位、外場 3位。",null,[0,127]]]],[null,1765354319000000,1765354319000000,"8 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQnN6VlZvWkV0WVpkZEE0TTlpSHNuUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQnN6VlZvWkV0WVpkZEE0TTlpSHNuURoTQ2d3SXo5Ymt5UVlRMnV2NHZ3RQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiijuC999mWAxWculYBHdcnF-EQ_2MImQEoDQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8270955745292171165/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVDA1cVRuVk1WMnN3VVd4c2FsRnFUbTVsVkZweFZFaFNNRlJXUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝 Chih-Jen 的用心分享與詳盡回饋！🙏\n非常感謝您細緻地描述店內環境與整體體驗，\n能讓您感受到湯頭的平衡與食材的新鮮，是我們最大的榮幸。\n同時也感謝您對服務與動線的建議，\n我們會持續檢視與改善，讓每一位客人都能享有更舒適順暢的用餐時光。\n\n期待下次再為您奉上一碗熱氣騰騰、真誠用心的拉麵！🍜\n\n— 赤羽拉麵 Akabane Ramen 敬上\n",null,[0,73]]]],[null,null,6789,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOT05qTnVMV